gy platforms and infrastructure allow merchants to accept debit cards, credit cards, prepaid instruments wallets, QR codes, unified payment interface (UPI), loyalty points, pay later, online fee collection, etc., as well as provide application programming interface (API) modules to customers for building financial products that facilitates bill payments, credit, and savings. It also engages in selling digital checkout points devices. The Issuing and Acquiring Platform segment provides a technology platform to issue, process, and distribute prepaid cards. It also monetizes by charging a processing fee from merchants who are utilizing the technology platform and in the case of distribution. The company was incorporated in 1998 and is based in Noida, India.","employees":5007,"earnDates":[],"exDiv":null,"asOf":1795256581},"analyst":{"key":null,"mean":null,"n":11,"tMean":220.45454,"tHigh":250,"tLow":190,"tMed":220,"currency":"INR","asOf":1795256581,"trend":{"strongBuy":1,"buy":9,"hold":1,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}},"cap":"Small","caFix":null,"fetched":1795256581,"source":"Yahoo Finance (public chart, fundamentals-timeseries & quoteSummary endpoints)","news":{"q":"\"Pine Labs\" when:90d","items":[{"t":"Paytm, Pine Labs, MobiKwik Shares Fall Up To 9% As UPI MDR Rollout Faces Fresh Delay","s":"BW Disrupt","d":1795169140,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxQaklwdVg1c2d2VkEycEQyZExkYlFCZGJZc1U4WXc4TE1KNmhpWTBkWkNsNnowVms5b0tLZDJySDJDLWJfemt0bDJXOXdLOUFfV0hGUmxLYkNCcFFWNG50VFRsZDdWeC1Uc2ZITXYxNVNNbnhIVTlWeWl1QzM3ZVZVQVBjd1ZuUmhUR1U0TmszZTJUQmpwcXhOSjQ5MkZEUzEwSlJ2ZnI4cklVcVNrMjNYazJtcFcyV2E1cWZ0enh0dw?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Paytm, Mobikwik, Pine Labs shares slide on UPI MDR delay report","s":"The Economic Times","d":1795135918,"u":"https://news.google.?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Paytm, Pine Labs shares plunge as UPI transaction fee rollout in India delayed","s":"Reuters","d":1795111600,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxQREVIY041TmJ5MU5vTkk2cElaT